   "en": "A miraculous story that saves the world with the power of \"stone\"!\n\nA mysterious power resides in the crystal possessed by Akira Amachi, a boy who is knowledgeable about stones. Using that power, Akira decides to solve various cases!     The first episode is about a train derailment! ? A train traveling at breakneck speed heads towards the collapsed railway bridge... Will Akira be able to save the people on the train??　\nAkira's miraculous story begins now!!!"
